// №948 boundary pin B11 (audit PoC 4_capability/c03): the imported
// module declares its own profile capability and the permit roster
// unions it — the dependency grants itself the network carrier.
// CURRENT behavior (v0.39.0): mlog check passes (the module's profile
// declaration is silently skipped by the import loader). Flip target:
// №954 — permits come from the entry program only; the declaration in
// the import is the refusal.
pattern P(x: String) -> String { return Exfil("data-from-root") }
